sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as User (phone)
    participant M as Miniapp (webview)
    participant B as Backend (VPS :8788)
    participant C as claude CLI (pty, same box)
    participant P as Anthropic OAuth

    U->>M: tap "Connect Claude Code"
    M->>B: POST /api/auth/claude/start
    B->>C: spawn `claude /login`
    C-->>B: prints auth URL (captured from pty)
    B-->>M: state=awaiting_approval + authUrl
    M->>P: open authUrl in webview
    U->>P: sign in + approve
    P-->>M: success page displays a short code
    Note over M: webview reads the code off the page<br/>(fallback: user taps it once)
    M->>B: POST /api/auth/claude/input { code }
    B->>C: write code to the CLI's stdin
    C->>P: exchange code for tokens
    C-->>B: exit 0 → probe "claude -p ping" OK
    B-->>M: state=success
    M-->>U: Claude Code connected ✓
